        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Baanch’ra nun tingkao thang rui,",
            "Zingbang lugai suan guang e,",
            "Luangbut guay rui neihla na",
            "Suandau na kagaeng bam e.",
            "",
            "Kauh....liangmei khou",
            "Ravguangc himdai diu. 2",
            "",
            "2. Lauziu gaenghmei nun nang niu",
            "Akummei riu phaeng hou na;",
            "Akummei gaycham chuna,",
            "Heidi neihla suanbam cho?",
            "",
            "3. Bethlehem thang guangzau lo",
            "Puan khou Baanch’ra guay lu tei;",
            "Khuksunna guang kalum o,",
            "Khrista Guangh thanh puancmei ta.",
            "",
            "4. Guaikuak khou tei guangzau lo",
            "Baanch’ra nun thuan bammei tei;",
            "Mary, Joshep khalou o,",
            "‘Niu lung zianna suan bam khou."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
